er substance  being touted in South America especially  as a miracle cure for kovat 19 the  compound has been sold on the fringes of  the internet for years as a purported  treatment for everything from cancer to  to autism many national health  authorities have issued warnings about  its dangers but in cities that have been  hit by the virus in Bolivia in  particular the idea that it can prevent  or cure kovat 19 has gained traction and  and people are lining up to buy it  chlorine dioxide is an industrial bleach  that can be toxic when ingested and  there have been many reports of people  poisoning themselves with it after  taking it you can develop symptoms that  include  severe vomiting and diarrhea acute low  blood pressure from dehydration and and  acute liver failure there's currently no  scientific evidence at all that the  bleaching agent can prevent or treat  covin 19  [Music]
 

